    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 987 of the laws of 1971 amending the education law and the civil practice law and rules relating to the regulation and practice of certain professions; and to continue the dental society of the state of New York, in relation to counting representation in the New York state dental association",
    "basePrintNo": "S3516",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S3516-2017",
